{"4950920":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Sweeplings","steam_appid":4950920,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5073270],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what’s hiding beneath the pods!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cute and curious puzzle game, you’ll use your wits — and sharp observation — to uncover hidden creatures called <strong><i>Voidlings<\/i><\/strong>, <strong><i>Starlings<\/i><\/strong>, and <strong><i>Boomlings<\/i><\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle hides a secret pattern of friendly and feisty creatures. Read the signals on the board, interpret the clues, and decide where to reveal, capture, or avoid. Can you uncover all the friendly Starlings while keeping the explosive Boomlings at bay?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you love logic puzzles like Minesweeper but want something warmer and more visual — with clues on the board instead of numbers — Sweeplings is for you.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Charming hand-crafted puzzles that mix logic and intuition<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Adorable creatures with distinct personalities<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Satisfying “scan and reveal” mechanics that reward clever deduction<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Blink — timer-based pods that wake when the clock runs out<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Arcade Mode — score-chase levels with personal best tracking<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Track puzzle progress, stars, and your best Arcade scores<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Relaxing visuals and ambient sound design<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quick levels perfect for short play sessions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Menus and UI in English<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No voice acting or subtitles — no spoken dialogue<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gameplay is visual and easy to follow<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your intuition to the test — find the hidden friends and avoid the troublemakers!<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what’s hiding beneath the pods!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cute and curious puzzle game, you’ll use your wits — and sharp observation — to uncover hidden creatures called <strong><i>Voidlings<\/i><\/strong>, <strong><i>Starlings<\/i><\/strong>, and <strong><i>Boomlings<\/i><\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle hides a secret pattern of friendly and feisty creatures. Read the signals on the board, interpret the clues, and decide where to reveal, capture, or avoid. Can you uncover all the friendly Starlings while keeping the explosive Boomlings at bay?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you love logic puzzles like Minesweeper but want something warmer and more visual — with clues on the board instead of numbers — Sweeplings is for you.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Charming hand-crafted puzzles that mix logic and intuition<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Adorable creatures with distinct personalities<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Satisfying “scan and reveal” mechanics that reward clever deduction<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Blink — timer-based pods that wake when the clock runs out<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Arcade Mode — score-chase levels with personal best tracking<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Track puzzle progress, stars, and your best Arcade scores<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Relaxing visuals and ambient sound design<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Quick levels perfect for short play sessions<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Language<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Menus and UI in English<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• No voice acting or subtitles — no spoken dialogue<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Gameplay is visual and easy to follow<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your intuition to the test — find the hidden friends and avoid the troublemakers!<\/p>","short_description":"A cute logic puzzle about scanning the board to find Starlings and avoid Boomlings. English UI · No spoken dialogue. If you love logic puzzles like Minesweeper but want something warmer and more visual — with clues on the board instead of numbers — Sweeplings is for you.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4950920\/da6606403b4ba65810ac3712a30330c915bf0f2f\/header.jpg?t=1793642113","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4950920\/d25a30ed5616c5095dd2e0205aea3150116a7f89\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642113","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4950920\/d25a30ed5616c5095dd2e0205aea3150116a7f89\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642113","website":"https:\/\/www.funnyem.com\/games","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU; Intel HD 520 \/ equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Dedicated GPU recommended<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Funnyem Inc."],"publishers":["Funnyem Inc."],"demos":[{"appid":5073270,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":699,"final":699,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$6.99"},"packages":[1718273],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Sweeplings","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1718273,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Sweeplings - $6.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":699}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":78,"description":"Adjustable Difficulty"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4950920\/49a95dee6481b6a778e13c25b02d1cfcfb4873b0\/ss_49a95dee6481b6a778e13c25b02d1cfcfb4873b0.600x338.jpg?t=1793642113","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4950920\/49a95dee6481b6a778e13c25b02d1cfcfb4873b0\/ss_49a95dee6481b6a778e13c25b02d1cfcfb4873b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793642113"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4950920\/2cb2325e2f8b515769d32e450242be9f235ec1dc\/s